  "entry": "code/app.py",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Upload a routine EDF recording with EEG and ECG channels, check how the channels were typed, review the traces, and compute EEG spectral and aperiodic measures plus ECG rhythm screening and HRV, with total and artifact-corrected results side by side, then export a report tagged with provenance. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
